 "description": "Build an Au309 icosahedral nanoparticle, Pt(111), graphene, hydroxylated silica (001) and rutile TiO2 (110); place hen egg-white lysozyme (PDB 1AKI) on Au(111), graphene and silica in water, minimize and analyse the contacts and adsorption energy. The QM steps start from the minimized lysozyme-gold structure recorded for the film (lyso_on_Au_minimized_site.pdb): cut a hydrogen-capped cluster at Arg68, MOPAC PM7 single point in COSMO water, HOMO/LUMO.",
